bounded.add_specific:
Rewrite the sentence by adding exactly one concrete detail to the same proposition. Keep every original substantive detail verbatim where practical. Add no example, explanation, purpose, background, second condition, or second sentence. Use at most {add_word_limit} words (the original has {original_word_count}). Preserve every name, number, identifier, code span, URL, polarity word, and modal word exactly.

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

bounded.de_specify:
Rewrite the sentence to be less specific by generalizing or removing exactly one concrete name, value, identifier, location, version, command, parameter, condition, or content-bearing qualifier. Add no new detail, example, explanation, or second sentence. Do not make the sentence longer than {de_word_limit} words (the original has {original_word_count}). Preserve the main proposition and every polarity and modal word exactly.

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

bounded.irrelevant_rewrite:
Paraphrase the sentence without changing specificity. Preserve every name, number, identifier, code span, URL, polarity word, and modal word exactly. Retain at least 60 percent of the original content words verbatim; change syntax or a few nontechnical words only. Add or remove no concrete detail and produce no second sentence. Use between {neutral_word_min} and {neutral_word_max} words (the original has {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

micro.add_specific:
Make one minimal edit that adds exactly one concrete detail to the same sentence. Do not add an example, explanation, purpose, background, or extra condition. Preserve the original wording, names, code, URLs, polarity, and modality. Return one sentence of at most {micro_add_word_limit} words (original: {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

micro.de_specify:
Make one minimal edit that removes or generalizes exactly one concrete detail or qualifier. Add nothing. Preserve all other wording, the proposition, polarity, and modality. Return one sentence no longer than {de_word_limit} words (original: {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

micro.irrelevant_rewrite:
Make a minimal wording or syntax paraphrase with the same specificity. Preserve all concrete details, at least 60 percent of content words verbatim, and every polarity and modal word exactly. Add and remove no detail. Return one sentence between {neutral_word_min} and {neutral_word_max} words (original: {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}
